Description: Clang 19 frontend (versioned)
 Installs under /var/jb/usr/lib/llvm-19 with clang-19 on PATH via a thin
 wrapper. Resource headers are in libclang-common-19-dev. Does not take over
 the unversioned clang name; install clang-default for that.
